What is the distance in kilometers between Seattle and Vancouver compared to the distance between Boston and New York in kilometers? Can you provide me with the Java code that calculates the distances between these cities using latitude and longitude values?
Here is the Java code that uses the Haversine formula to calculate the distance between two cities given their latitude and longitude values:
public static final double RADIUS_EARTH_KM = 6371;
public static double calculateDistance(double lat1, double lon1, double lat2, double lon2) {
    double latDistance = Math.toRadians(lat2 - lat1);
    double lonDistance = Math.toRadians(lon2 - lon1);
    double a = Math.sin(latDistance / 2) * Math.sin(latDistance / 2)
            + Math.cos(Math.toRadians(lat1)) * Math.cos(Math.toRadians(lat2))
            * Math.sin(lonDistance / 2) * Math.sin(lonDistance / 2);
    double c = 2 * Math.atan2(Math.sqrt(a), Math.sqrt(1 - a));
    double distance = RADIUS_EARTH_KM * c;
    return distance;
}
